Package: HRTrim
Title: Marker-Based Heart Rate Analysis
Version: 0.0.0.9100
Authors@R: 
    person("Finn", "Dreisigacker", , "dreisigacker.finn@web.de", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A local Shiny application for marker-based heart rate analysis of
    Polar CSV files. Provides an Excel-like column picker (time/hr), start/end
    trimming, %HRmax and lactate-threshold training zones, and a continuously
    appended Excel export for sport science workflows.
